<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT BOLIVIA 3-1 IN COPA AMERICA FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT BOLIVIA 3-1 IN COPA AMERICA FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Bolivia 3-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in the Copa America final on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brazil - Edmundo (37th minute), Ronaldo (79), Ze Roberto</p>
<p>(90)</p>
<p>Bolivia - Erwin Sanchez (45)</p>
<p>Attendance: 46,000</p>
